  "_note": "Autovero. The rate is a lookup by CO2, one row per gram from 0 to 360 and above, taken from the consolidated Autoverolaki 777/2020, table 1 A (WLTP). Two things are commonly got wrong: there is no zero rate for electric cars — at 0 g/km they land on the table's lowest row, 2.7% — and the base is not the price paid. The law defines it as the general retail value the same car would fetch on the Finnish market and expressly bars the actual purchase price as the sole basis, so the price paid stands in its place and the line says so in red.",
